Rem AMCAF Turbo Draw: the octants, the clipping, patterns, plane masks, the XOR edges (the golden is the original's)
Screen Open 0,320,200,16,Lowres : Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 0
Set Line $FFFF
Cls 0
Turbo Draw 10,10 To 100,30,15
Turbo Draw 10,10 To 30,100,15
Turbo Draw 150,10 To 100,100,5
Turbo Draw 160,10 To 200,18,3
Turbo Draw 200,30 To 160,40,9
Turbo Draw 20,150 To 100,120,12
Turbo Draw 100,150 To 20,190,6
Turbo Draw 230,20 To 230,120,15
Turbo Draw 250,20 To 310,20,15
Turbo Draw 250,60 To 250,60,15
Turbo Draw 270,60 To 271,61,7
DUMP
Cls 0
Turbo Draw -20,-10 To 100,60,15
Turbo Draw 300,-30 To 340,80,3
Turbo Draw -50,100 To 400,110,5
Turbo Draw 150,-50 To 170,300,9
Turbo Draw 0,0 To 319,199,15
Turbo Draw 319,0 To 0,199,14
Turbo Draw -100,50 To -10,60,15
Turbo Draw 400,50 To 500,60,15
Turbo Draw 100,250 To 120,300,15
Turbo Draw 20,-1 To 60,-8,15
DUMP
Cls 0
Set Line $F0F0
Turbo Draw 10,20 To 300,25,15
Turbo Draw 10,30 To 300,31,7
Set Line $8421
Turbo Draw 20,40 To 20,190,15
Turbo Draw 30,40 To 310,190,15
Set Line $AAAA
Turbo Draw 310,40 To 40,60,15
Set Line $FFFF
DUMP
Cls 0
Turbo Draw 10,10 To 100,60,15,1
Turbo Draw 20,10 To 110,60,15,2
Turbo Draw 30,10 To 120,60,15,12
Turbo Draw 40,10 To 130,60,5,15
Turbo Draw 50,10 To 140,60,0,15
Turbo Draw 60,10 To 150,60,15,0
DUMP
Cls 0
Turbo Draw 100,20 To 150,80,15,-1
Turbo Draw 150,80 To 100,120,15,-1
Turbo Draw 100,120 To 100,20,15,-1
Turbo Draw 200,20 To 250,20,15,-1
Turbo Draw 200,30 To 280,35,15,-3
Turbo Draw 10,10 To 80,10,15,-1
DUMP
Cls 0
Turbo Draw -30,20 To 40,60,15,-1
Turbo Draw 300,20 To 350,100,15,-1
Turbo Draw 280,150 To 380,170,15,-1
Turbo Draw -10,170 To 100,190,15,-1
DUMP
Cls 0
For I=0 To 30
Turbo Draw I*10,0 To 319-I*10,199,I Mod 16
Turbo Draw 0,I*6 To 319,199-I*6,15-(I Mod 16)
Next I
DUMP
Print #1,"end"
Procedure DUMP
 Blitter Wait
 For P=0 To 3
 For Y=0 To 199 Step 3
 C=0
 For X=0 To 38 Step 2
 C=C+Deek(Logbase(P)+Y*40+X)*(X+1)
 Next X
 Print #1,C;" ";
 Next Y
 Print #1,""
 Next P
End Proc
